old black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]path[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]target-resolution[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]target-resolution: resolve the post-commit publication target by [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]matching the commit's repository path against the repo inventory [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF](including workspace clones) so sidecar and linked-repo commits publish [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]to the host project, and stop the auxiliary publication step from [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]failing a commit that already landed.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Retire publication requests that can never be published[/bold #D7AFFF]       [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]terminal-disposition[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]terminal-disposition: add a durable terminal disposition to the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]publication outbox, classify \"hood has no publishable runs\" as terminal [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]once a retry has confirmed it, and stop `--retry-quarantined` from [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]resurrecting terminal requests into an endless quarantine cycle.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Operator surface for retired requests and residue cleanup[/bold #D7AFFF]     [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]unpublishable-surface[dim] · [dim][/dim]after terminal-disposition[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]unpublishable-surface: expose retired requests through `sase agent [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]sync`, `sase doctor`, and the post-commit warning with accurate [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]remediation, and purge the three residue requests currently stuck in [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]this machine's sase outbox.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-ah","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.6-sol","phase_bead_id":"sase-ah.1","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-dfd220a684444dec32b317a89f0ce4ec","started_at":"2026-07-28T18:19:55.350950+00:00","state":"completed"}],"schema_version":2,"structural_ancestors":["bbugyi200.athena.sase-ah","bbugyi200.athena.sase-ah.1","bbugyi200.athena.sase-ah.2","bbugyi200.athena.sase-ah.3","bbugyi200.athena.sase-ah.land"]}
